{"id":"vod_bf_42110","vodId":"42110","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"异国迷宫的十字路口","name_cn":"异国迷宫的十字路口","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-43/acc451af10631c1f5bf4f1e87088d55d.jpg"},"summary":"在法国浪漫华丽的街道上，出现了一个身着红色和服的黑发少女，她的身影与环境格格不入，却又散发着让人无法移开视线的魅力。这名和服少女叫做汤音（东山奈央 配音），从日本长崎远道而来的她希望能够在法国找到一份称心的工作。经人介绍，汤音认识了法国少年克劳德（近藤隆 配音），并进入了他和爷爷奥斯卡（田中秀幸 配音）一同经营的“国王的长廊”铁艺店工作。　　起初，汤音并不是太能适应在异国的生活，在认识了异常热衷于日本文化的大小姐爱丽丝（悠木碧 配音）后，对客人和朋友渐渐熟悉的汤音开始领悟到法国独特的风土人情。同时，在生活喝学习的过程中，汤音和克劳德结下了坚实的友谊，成为了彼此非常重要的存在。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:06:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yiguomigongdeshizilukou/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:28.502Z"